+# StonkGuy/dxmt, branch `steamac`
+
+Downstream DXMT for [steamac](https://github.com/StonkGuy/steamac)'s DXMT graphics path: Direct3D 10/11 (and
+12) games under Proton in an ARM64 Linux VM on a Mac, with DXMT's Metal calls remoted to the macOS host by
+steamac's `wmtr` transport. The branch is upstream `3Shain/dxmt` `main` plus the commits below, one commit per
+change. Commits adopted from other DXMT forks are cherry-picked with `git cherry-pick -x`, so each keeps its
+original author and names its source commit; a follow-up commit of ours adapts it where needed.
+
+* Base: 3Shain/dxmt `e94c312` (2026-10-09).
+* steamac pins a commit of this branch (`host/dxmt/pin.env`) and ships it as generated patches
+  (`scripts/export-dxmt-patches.sh`); there are no tags or releases here.
+* Licence: LGPL-2.1-or-later, as upstream (`COPYING.LIB`, `LICENSE`). Nothing from GPL-only forks is included;
+  two ideas seen in a GPL-3.0 fork were implemented independently from their description (marked below).
+* **Policy: nothing from this branch is submitted to 3Shain/dxmt.** DXMT does not accept AI-assisted
+  contributions, and parts of this branch were written with AI assistance. Bug reports about this branch are
+  welcome as issues on this repository.
+
+## Tests
+
+* `tests/regression/` (from SteveTanSaMa/DXMT, host-run, no GPU window):
+  `meson setup build-regress tests/regression && meson test -C build-regress` (scheduler lifetime, Reference
+  ownership, shader bitcode cleanup). All three fail to build on upstream `main`, pass here.
+* steamac `wmtr/`: `make test` (loopback incl. out-error ownership), `make test-linux` (guest client),
+  `wmtr/tests/d3d11bench.cpp` and `d3d12bench.cpp` (A/B benchmarks in the VM),
+  `wmtr/tests/dxmt_member_order_check.py`.
+* Upstream's `tests/dx11` are interactive windowed samples, not automated.
+
